From 610bcd114877600e3ea3f46626334df5375809ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: keptn42 <keptn42@noreply.codeberg.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 11:53:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] four-rank Flash-Next: the shared and plain experts'
 remainders go to ranks 2 and 3

At four ranks the routed parity split leaves ranks 0 and 1 widest, and the
shared expert's extra block and the plain bf16 experts' extra tiles were cut
from rank 0 as well. Both remainders now go to the ranks the routed split
leaves narrowest. One and two ranks declare byte for byte as before.
