From: keptn42 <keptn42@noreply.codeberg.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 11:55:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] four-rank Flash-Next: the routed experts in four classes

The parity split gave ranks 0..3 30/30/20/20 % of the routed work. The extra
block of each five-block expert now goes round all four ranks by expert id
mod 4: rank r takes two blocks of class r and one of each other class, a
quarter each. The plain experts' extra tiles move to ranks 0 and 1 so they
do not stack on the shared expert's. One and two ranks declare as before.
